sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Reporter
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant Auth as Auth Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Reporter->>GW: POST /auth/register or POST /auth/login
  GW->>GW: Apply auth rate limit
  alt Register new reporter
    GW->>Auth: Forward registration request over REST
    Auth->>DB: Check normalized email
    DB-->>Auth: Email not registered
    Note over Auth: Hash password with scrypt and save reporter account
    Auth->>DB: Insert user record
    DB-->>Auth: User profile
    Auth-->>GW: Created account profile
    GW-->>Reporter: 201 account created. Login separately for a token
  else Login existing reporter
    GW->>Auth: Forward login request over REST
    Auth->>DB: Find user by normalized email
    DB-->>Auth: User and password hash
    Note over Auth: Verify password with scrypt and timing safe comparison
    Auth-->>GW: HS256 access token and user profile
    GW-->>Reporter: 201 access token and profile
    Note over Auth: Invalid email or password returns the same 401 response
  end
